===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Emolga|37}} from the {{TCG|Noble Victories}} expansion.
*'''Static Shock''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Mareep|94}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
